#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:156
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_AdviceForContests"
msgid ""
"Want a tasty little bit of advice\n"
"for CONTESTS?\p"
"Using a certain move after another\n"
"certain kind of move sometimes gets\l"
"you extra attention.\p"
"If you know what you're doing,\n"
"you can score big in appeal.\p"
"Of course, your opponents might try\n"
"disrupting your POKéMON's showing.$"
msgstr ""
"想听听关于华丽大赛的小建议吗？\p"
"在某种招式之后接着使用特定的招式，\n"
"有时候能吸引更多的关注。\p"
"只要你心里有数，\n"
"就能在表演中拿到高分。\p"
"当然，对手也可能会想办法干扰你的\n"
"宝可梦的表演。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:168
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_MyPapaIsContestJudge"
msgid ""
"My papa, he's a CONTEST JUDGE.\p"
"I wonder what I should be when I\n"
"grow up, a JUDGE or a GYM LEADER?$"
msgstr ""
"我爸爸是华丽大赛的评审。\p"
"我长大以后该当什么好呢？\n"
"评审，还是道馆馆主？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:174
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_ImLikeMajorlyCheesed"
msgid ""
"Hey, man, I'm like majorly cheesed,\n"
"you know. Like, you know, I just\l"
"wanted to know why my POKéMON\l"
"never won, you know, like, hey?\p"
"So, like, I gave the JUDGE my two\n"
"cents, you know, they're free.\p"
"And he wouldn't hear me out, like, hey!\n"
"So, like, total bummer, man!\p"
"Hey, like, you! Zip it, you know?\n"
"Just, you know, take this!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，老兄，我简直超级火大，\n"
"你懂吧？我就是想知道，为什么我的\l"
"宝可梦总是赢不了，你懂吧，对吧？\p"
"所以，我就跟评审发表了一下我的高见，\n"
"你懂的，反正不要钱嘛。\p"
"结果他根本不听我说，真是的！\n"
"简直太扫兴了，老兄！\p"
"喂，就是你！闭嘴，懂吗？\n"
"总之，你懂的，拿着这个！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:187
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_ExplainTorment"
msgid ""
"That's, like, TM41, you know?\n"
"Hey, it's TORMENT, you hearing me?\p"
"Like, it won't let the other guy\n"
"use the same move twice in a row, see?\p"
"Hey, now, you listen here, like,\n"
"I'm not laying a torment on you!$"
msgstr ""
"那个嘛，就是招式学习器41，\n"
"懂吗？嘿，是无理取闹，听到没？\p"
"就是说，它能让对手没法连续两\n"
"次使用同一个招式，懂了吧？\p"
"喂，你给我听好了，\n"
"我可没有在对你无理取闹哦！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:196
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_MCStepUpTakePartInContest"
msgid ""
"MC: Oh, my, my!\n"
"Now isn't that a dandy of a POKéMON?\p"
"Please! Do step right up and take\n"
"part in our splendid CONTESTS!\p"
"You'll do well! I'm sure of it!\n"
"My eyes have never failed me!$"
msgstr ""
"主持人：哎呀呀呀！\n"
"这只宝可梦真是太棒了！\p"
"请！请务必上台来参加我们精彩的\n"
"华丽大赛吧！\p"
"你一定能表现得很好！我敢肯定！\n"
"我的眼光从来没有错过！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:205
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_JudgeWouldntDoToMissContest"
msgid ""
"JUDGE: Well, hello there!\n"
"I see that you're a TRAINER!\p"
"Then, it just wouldn't do for you\n"
"to miss a POKéMON CONTEST!\p"
"Get a CONTEST PASS in VERDANTURF\n"
"CITY and enter anytime!$"
msgstr ""
"评审：哎呀，你好！\n"
"我看得出你是一位训练家！\p"
"那么，你可不能错过宝可梦华丽大赛哦！\p"
"去绿荫镇拿一张华丽大赛参加证，\n"
"随时都可以参赛！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:214
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_ItsAppealTime"
msgid ""
"It's appeal time!\n"
"What should I lead with?$"
msgstr "表演时间到了！我该先用什么招式呢？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:219
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_DidntPayAttentionToAppeal"
msgid ""
"They didn't pay much attention to\n"
"my POKéMON's appeal…\p"
"Humph, that JUDGE, he doesn't know\n"
"a good thing when he sees it.$"
msgstr ""
"大家都没怎么注意我的宝可梦的表演……\p"
"哼，那个评审，真是有眼不识泰山。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:226
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_RewardWithSageAdvice"
msgid ""
"Oh, hi! You must be a serious fan to get\n"
"this close to the action.\p"
"I'll reward your enthusiasm with\n"
"this sage advice.\p"
"If a move goes over really well,\n"
"the audience will get excited.\p"
"The POKéMON that makes its appeal\n"
"right when everyone's excited…\p"
"Well, you'd think something good has\n"
"to happen!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你好！能凑到这么近来看，\n"
"你一定是个狂热的粉丝吧。\p"
"为了奖励你的热情，\n"
"我就给你一个宝贵的建议吧。\p"
"如果某个招式表现得非常出色，\n"
"观众就会兴奋起来。\p"
"在大家都很兴奋的\n"
"时候进行表演的宝可梦……\p"
"嗯，你想想就知道，\n"
"肯定会有好事发生的！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:239
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_MoreFreakedOutThanMon"
msgid ""
"I can't do this! I'm more freaked out\n"
"than my POKéMON.\p"
"I'm shivering and my heart is racing!$"
msgstr ""
"我不行了！我比我的宝可梦还要紧张。\p"
"浑身发抖，心跳得好快！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:245
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_BattleAndContestAlike"
msgid ""
"A battle and a CONTEST aren't the\n"
"same, but they are alike, too.\p"
"You need to work hard and believe\n"
"in the POKéMON you've raised.$"
msgstr ""
"对战和华丽大赛虽然不一样，\n"
"但也有相似之处。\p"
"你都需要努力，\n"
"并且相信自己培养的宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:252
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_MonLooksOnTopOfGame"
msgid ""
"That POKéMON looks like it's on top\n"
"of its game, huh?\p"
"A POKéMON that does good in the\n"
"secondary judging seems to be more\l"
"relaxed when it's doing appeals.$"
msgstr ""
"那只宝可梦看起来状态很好，对吧？\p"
"在第二轮审查中表现好的宝可梦，\n"
"表演的时候好像也会更加放松。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:260
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_MyMonBetterThanThatLot"
msgid ""
"Will you look at that sorry sight?\p"
"Heh, my POKéMON's absolutely better\n"
"than that lot!$"
msgstr ""
"你看看那副可怜的样子！\p"
"哼，我的宝可梦绝对比那些家伙强多了！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:266
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_GetUrgeToMoveWithMon"
msgid ""
"Don't you get the urge to move with\n"
"POKéMON if they're putting on an\l"
"energetic appeal?$"
msgstr ""
"看到宝可梦充满活力地表演，\n"
"你不会也想跟着一起动起来吗？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:272
msgctxt "SlateportCity_ContestHall_Text_HyperRankStage"
msgid ""
"POKéMON CONTESTS\n"
"HYPER RANK STAGE!$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦华丽大赛\n"
"高级级别会场！$"
